{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u015eahmaran \u2013 A Mysterious Adventure with Chief Cenab</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to chase mysterious events and dark secrets? Step into the shoes of <strong>Chief Cenab</strong> and solve puzzles, interact with characters, and uncover secrets in this world brought to life through a black-and-white comic book style with special color highlights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A boring day</strong> starting in the office turns into a silent yet captivating journey that pulls you deep into the past. The dialogues you form with characters and the puzzles you solve will carry you to the heart of the story and guide you toward solving the mysterious events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles are structured as part of the story; every solution opens the door to a new secret. <strong>\u015eahmaran</strong> invites you to an immersive experience with its atmosphere and the challenges of its brain-teasing puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Close-Up Menu Opening &amp; Closing</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939850/extras/e4e43d879028ccd44719bd488f861ce7.poster.avif?t=1771824013\" width=1170 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939850/extras/e4e43d879028ccd44719bd488f861ce7.webm?t=1771824013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939850/extras/e4e43d879028ccd44719bd488f861ce7.mp4?t=1771824013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Item Coll